---
/*
 * Override of Starlight's ThemeProvider that locks the site to dark.
 *
 * The stock component derives the theme from a stored preference or the
 * reader's system setting, which is what powers the light/dark/auto switcher.
 * Cascade ships dark-only, so this replacement hardcodes `data-theme="dark"`
 * on the document element. The script stays inlined so the value is set
 * before first paint, avoiding any flash of a light background.
 *
 * `StarlightThemeProvider.updatePickers` is retained as a no-op so any stray
 * caller stays safe now that the picker (ThemeSelect) renders nothing.
 */
---

{/* Intentionally inlined to set the theme before first paint. */}
<script is:inline>
	window.StarlightThemeProvider = {
		updatePickers() {},
	};
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
</script>
